WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.610 line:78% align:center
I'm the talent director at Kellanova.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.700 line:78% align:center
So it's kind of like running
a football team.

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.870 line:78% align:center
So one of the things is I need to go out
and I need to scout who are the

00:00:09.890 --> 00:00:12.530 line:78% align:center
players who are playing in the junior
leagues and I want to bring them

00:00:12.550 --> 00:00:16.920 line:78% align:center
into this football club. Then if I think
about learning and development,

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:20.870 line:78% align:center
what are the courses or activities I want
them to do to build up their

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:24.020 line:78% align:center
skills? And then I'm doing the
talent management.

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:28.190 line:78% align:center
Which players am I going to put in which
position on the field and which

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:31.780 line:78% align:center
people am I going to promote from
the bench onto the field?

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:37.440 line:78% align:center
That's talent management. So there's
different ways to get into talent

00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:42.290 line:78% align:center
management. One is either bachelor of
business or bachelor of commerce.

00:00:42.440 --> 00:00:45.010 line:78% align:center
Another avenue is the
bachelor of psychology.

00:00:45.360 --> 00:00:49.020 line:78% align:center
So people either come from psychology
background or a business background

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:52.840 line:78% align:center
into human resources. One thing which I
advise people to do while they're

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.370 line:78% align:center
at university is to join business
societies, do business competitions,

00:00:58.820 --> 00:01:01.990 line:78% align:center
do volunteering experience,
or internships.

00:01:02.340 --> 00:01:06.180 line:78% align:center
It's very important that you diversify your
skills and experiences while

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.480 line:78% align:center
you're at university. So if you're interested
in a career in talent management,

00:01:10.500 --> 00:01:13.850 line:78% align:center
one of the things you need to be very
confident at is communication.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:17.670 line:78% align:center
I hope this was helpful and thank you for
your interest in Kellanova.
